              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2
                class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4"
              >
                14. Changes to Terms
              </h2>
              <p class="text-secondary-700 leading-relaxed">
                We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes
